<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000178> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "A page of a paperback novel with writing on it. The paper itself is a material information bearer, the pattern of ink is the information carrier."@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000178> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "a brain"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000178> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "a hard drive"@en .
