<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000686> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Name"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Designative Information Content Entity that consists of a string of characters that designates an entity within a specified cultural or social namespace and which is typically a word or phrase in a natural language that has an accepted cultural or social significance."@en .
