<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000005> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Process in which at least one Agent plays a causative role."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000005> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
