<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000228> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> _:g64ebd108af_cbfc499211e606cc683e2bcfc0ec1f2aa1107f01f4831547b13c6ec58694668e98 .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Intentional Act"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act in which at least one Agent plays a causative role and which is prescribed by some Directive Information Content Entity held by at least one of the Agents."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000228> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000253> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
