<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000965> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> _:g64ebd108af_cb1bd154efbce83ce95f5a974b5485aa5d1bce7910567cfbcb6880db15929d65ee6 .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000965> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Directive ICE"@en .
